    "# Bluestock Mutual Fund Analytics — Day 3: Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook conducts Exploratory Data Analysis across 15 core business questions, producing readable visualization charts saved to `charts/` and summarizing key business findings."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {},
